  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Stallion 3**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **Learning love**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Pandy**: rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n- **Bare Hands**: rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **Don't Get to Close**: rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2008-01-24.mk41.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 30 songs; 149 min [1]\n- **ween2008-01-24**: source not stated; 30 songs; 145 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2008-01-24.mk41.flac16**: taped by Todd (titotito at gmail); transferred by Todd (titotito at gmail); source: mk41 > kc5 > cmc6 > m248 > mini-me > hd-p2 (24/96) [1]. Also: Recorded from the second-floor balcony, center in front of the board, microphones aimed at the stacks, using a 7-foot clamp [1]\n- **ween2008-01-24**: taped by Chris King; transferred by Chris King; source: M-audio24/96/ Pre Amp:Church-Audio ST-9100 stereo microphone preamp /Mics Church-Audio STC-11 stereo cardioid microphone [2]",
